{"path":"string/byte/strcmp","title":"std::strcmp","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>strcmp","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/byte/strcmp","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Compares two null-terminated byte strings lexicographically.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstring\">&lt;cstring&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> strcmp<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> lhs, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two null-terminated byte strings lexicographically.\n</p><p>The sign of the result is the sign of the difference between the values of the first pair of characters (both interpreted as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code>) that differ in the strings being compared.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are not pointers to null-terminated strings.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointers to the null-terminated byte strings to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Negative value if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> appears before <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> in lexicographical order.\n</p><p>Zero if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> compare equal.\n</p><p>Positive value if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> appears after <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> in lexicographical order.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstring&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> cats<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Heathcliff\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"Snagglepuss\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"Hobbes\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"Garfield\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/sort\"><span class=\"kw1629\">std::<span class=\"me2\">sort</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>cats.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, cats.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> strA, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> strB<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">strcmp</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>strA, strB<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> cat <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> cats<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> cat <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Garfield\nHeathcliff\nHobbes\nSnagglepuss</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strncmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strncmp</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares a certain number of characters from two strings <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wcscmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wcscmp</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two wide strings <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/memcmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>memcmp</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two buffers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcoll\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strcoll</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two strings in accordance to the current locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/byte/strcmp\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>strcmp</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/byte","title":"Null-terminated byte strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::strcmp","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Compares two null-terminated byte strings lexicographically."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Negative value if lhs appears before rhs in lexicographical order."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"strncmp","note":"compares a certain number of characters from two strings"},{"label":"wcscmp","note":"compares two wide strings"},{"label":"memcmp","note":"compares two buffers"},{"label":"strcoll","note":"compares two strings in accordance to the current locale"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":195,"codeBlockCount":2}
